ative, in-person survey of the noninstitutionalized U.S. civilian population\"}]},\n  {\"v\": \"before/after or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Current cigarette smoking prevalence among working adults aged ≥18 years was 22.2% in 2005 and 19.1% in 2010\"}]}\n ],\n \"methods_quotes\": [\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Sample weights were used to account for the complex sample design.\"},\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Estimates with a relative standard error of ≥30% are not reported.\"},\n  {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Two-tailed t-tests were used to determine statistically significant differences between point estimates.\"},\n  {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The estimate was age-adjusted to the 2000 U.S. standard population using the age groups 18–24, 25–34, 35–44, 45–64, and ≥65 years\"}\n ],\n \"confidence\": \"high\",\n \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}\n```", "type": "text"}]}